      "status": "not_affected",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "2026-07-30: the flaw is an unauthenticated DoS in JLine's Telnet server (NAWS terminal-geometry handling). ZooKeeper 3.9.5 depends on JLine only for zkCli.sh line editing and never constructs a Telnet server, so org.jline.builtins.telnet is never on an execution path. The finding is reported because upstream ships jline 3.25.1 as a single uber-jar with the telnet module bundled in, so the classes cannot be removed without repacking the jar. Not overridable either: the fix is jline 4.2.1, and jline 4.x is an API break for zkCli. Re-check when ZooKeeper moves off the 3.x jline line."
    },
