      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "2026-07-30: same component and same reasoning as GHSA-2r2c-cx56-8933 — a JLine Telnet server flaw in a module that ships inside the jline uber-jar but is never instantiated by ZooKeeper, which uses JLine only for zkCli.sh line editing. Fixed only in jline 4.2.1, an API break for zkCli. Re-check when ZooKeeper moves off the 3.x jline line."
